# Eine kleine Nachtmusik, arranged by Claude and SZ. Four bars of open hats, then Mozart over a pulsing bass.
title: Eine kleine Nachtmusik
composer: Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart
arranger: Claude & SZ
about: The title means "a little serenade". Mozart finished it in August 1787 while he was also writing the opera Don Giovanni, but it was not published until about forty years later, long after his death.
year: 1787
source: public-domain
category: classics
key: G major
hidden: true
style: techno
tempo: 128
time: 4/4

